        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n@startuml\ntitle UML Activity Diagram - CI/CD ParkirPintar\n\nstart\n\n:Trigger pipeline:\\nPush ke GitHub via webhook/ngrok\\natau Jenkins Build Now;\n\n:Checkout branch devops/jenkinsfile;\n\n:Siapkan container pengujian Docker\\n(ci/Dockerfile.test);\n\n:Jalankan PHPUnit dengan SQLite in-memory;\n\n:Simpan laporan JUnit XML bila dihasilkan;\n\nif (Tahap Test berhasil?) then (Ya)\n\n  :Build Docker Image aplikasi;\n\n  :Push Image ke Docker Hub;\n\n  :Deploy melalui Docker Compose\\n(app + MySQL, migrate);\n\n  :Smoke Test GET /health;\n\n  if (HTTP 200?) then (Ya)\n    :Status SUCCESS;\n  else (Tidak)\n    :Status FAILURE;\n  endif\n\nelse (Tidak)\n\n  :Quality Gate memblokir pipeline;\n\n  :Build, Push, Deploy, dan Smoke Test dilewati;\n\n  :Status FAILURE;\n\nendif\n\n:Post action:\\nPublikasikan JUnit XML jika tersedia;\n\nstop\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="j-GtkB_e2ciMsLFi1l0w-1">
